        // Prebuilt Slang shader compiler (`slangc`), one archive per host
        // platform. Only the dependency matching the build host is fetched
        // (all are lazy); `build.zig` picks it and runs `bin/slangc` to compile
        // the example `.slang` shaders. Override with `-Dslangc=/path/to/slangc`
        // (e.g. the Vulkan SDK's) to skip the download entirely. Pinned to
        // Slang v2026.11 — bump the URLs + hashes together to upgrade.
        .slang_linux_x86_64 = .{
            .url = "https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/releases/download/v2026.11/slang-2026.11-linux-x86_64.tar.gz",
